<body>
<div id="topline"><div id="topline-fill"></div></div>

<div id="welcome-screen">
  <div class="welcome-inner">
    <div class="welcome-title">One tower.<br>Every trade, every peso.</div>
    <div class="welcome-sub">ARTIFIELD — schedule, cost, and materials, standardized by Vex AI and read by one decision engine.</div>
    <button class="btn btn-white-pill" id="welcome-cta-btn" onclick="enterDashboard()">Enter ArtiSlide</button>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="message-overlay" class="hidden">
  <div style="text-align:center;">
    <div class="char-reveal" id="overlay-wordmark-text" style="font-size:60px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:800;"></div>
    <div class="char-reveal" id="overlay-sub-text" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--c2);letter-spacing:.02em;margin-top:8px;"></div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="version-static show" id="version-static">v1.2.0.0.0.0.0.0</div>

<div id="stage">
  <div id="track">

    <!-- 0 THE REALITY -->
    <section class="slide" data-idx="0">
      <div class="slide-inner">
        <div class="slide-eyebrow"><span class="ln"></span>THE REALITY</div>
        <h2 class="h-section" style="max-width:640px;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px);line-height:1.2;"><span id="reality-heading-text" class="char-reveal"></span></h2>
        <p class="lede reveal-item" data-step="1"><span id="reality-lede-text" class="char-reveal"></span></p>
        <div class="problem-grid cols-3">
          <div class="card problem-card reveal-item" data-step="2" onclick="openProblemModal(this)" data-solution="ARTIFIELD reads the schedule, cost sheet, or NCR log itself — Vex extracts it into one live database." data-target="2" data-target-label="Consolidated Gantt">
            <div class="pc-head"><div class="icon-tile"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5.5" rx="8" ry="3"/><path d="M4 5.5V12c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3V5.5"/><path d="M4 12v6.5c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3V12"/></svg></div><div><div class="pc-title">Schedule lives in 12 Excel files</div></div></div>
            <div class="problem-detail"><div class="problem-detail-inner">Every trade keeps its own CSA sheet, updated on its own schedule — nobody has one number for "where are we today."</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="card problem-card reveal-item" data-step="3" onclick="openProblemModal(this)" data-solution="ARTIFIELD's EVM engine computes CPI, EAC and VAC live, per building, the moment cost entries land." data-target="3" data-target-label="Finance & Cost">
            <div class="pc-head"><div class="icon-tile"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2v20M17 6.5C17 4.6 14.8 3 12 3S7 4.6 7 6.5 9.2 9.5 12 9.5s5 1.5 5 3.5-2.2 3.5-5 3.5-5-1.5-5-3.5"/></svg></div><div><div class="pc-title">Cost overruns discovered at closeout</div></div></div>
            <div class="problem-detail"><div class="problem-detail-inner">Budget vs. actual gets reconciled once, at the end — by then the overrun is already baked into the building.</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="card problem-card reveal-item" data-step="4" onclick="openProblemModal(this)" data-cost="Site downtime" data-cost-type="qualitative" data-solution="ARTIFIELD tracks days-of-supply against lead time per SKU, per building, and flags shortages before the crew is idle." data-target="4" data-target-label="Materials & Supply">
            <div class="pc-head"><div class="icon-tile"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 8l9-5 9 5-9 5-9-5z"/><path d="M3 8v8l9 5 9-5V8"/><path d="M12 13v8"/></svg></div><div><div class="pc-title">Material runs out mid-pour</div></div></div>
            <div class="problem-detail"><div class="problem-detail-inner">Nobody was watching the stockroom against the lead time, so the crew stands idle waiting on cement that should've been ordered two weeks ago.</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="card problem-card reveal-item" data-step="5" onclick="openProblemModal(this)" data-cost="Rework risk" data-cost-type="qualitative" data-solution="ARTIFIELD's clash engine flags sequence violations and space/time overlaps automatically, per floor, per trade." data-target="5" data-target-label="Clash & Sequence Log">
            <div class="pc-head"><div class="icon-tile"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3l9 16H3z"/><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13.5"/></svg></div><div><div class="pc-title">Two trades collide on the same floor</div></div></div>
            <div class="problem-detail"><div class="problem-detail-inner">Plumbing rough-in starts before CSA finishing clears — nobody flagged the sequence conflict until the crews were already on site.</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="card problem-card reveal-item" data-step="6" onclick="openProblemModal(this)" data-cost="Fragmented records" data-cost-type="qualitative" data-solution="ARTIFIELD ties RFIs, VOs, NCRs and quantity takedowns to the same schedule and cost database." data-target="4" data-target-label="Field Data (Vex)">
            <div class="pc-head"><div class="icon-tile"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 2h9l5 5v15H6z"/><path d="M15 2v5h5"/></svg></div><div><div class="pc-title">RFIs, VOs, NCRs in separate binders</div></div></div>
            <div class="problem-detail"><div class="problem-detail-inner">Variation orders and NCRs live in their own folders, disconnected from the schedule and cost they actually affect.</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="card problem-card reveal-item" data-step="7" onclick="openProblemModal(this)" data-cost="Decision bottleneck" data-cost-type="qualitative" data-solution="Vex AI surfaces the structural finding — the PM approves or overrides, from anywhere." data-target="6" data-target-label="Meet Vex AI">
            <div class="pc-head"><div class="icon-tile"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.5"/><path d="M3 19c0-3.3 2.7-5.5 6-5.5s6 2.2 6 5.5"/><path d="M18 8v5M15.5 10.5h5"/></svg></div><div><div class="pc-title">Every decision waits for the PM</div></div></div>
            <div class="problem-detail"><div class="problem-detail-inner">A schedule shift or cost flag sits idle until the project manager is free to review yet another spreadsheet.</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal-item" data-step="8" style="margin-top:26px;display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;">
          <div>
            <div style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px);color:var(--c1);line-height:1.2;"><span id="reality-itworks-text" class="char-reveal"></span></div>
            <div style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px);color:var(--c3);line-height:1.2;"><span id="reality-untilbusy-text" class="char-reveal"></span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;">
          <button class="btn btn-white-pill reveal-item" id="reality-cta-btn" onclick="goToImpact();">
            Estimate Your Impact
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 1 THE ENGINE -->
    <section class="slide" data-idx="1">
      <div class="slide-inner">
        <div class="slide-eyebrow"><span class="ln"></span>THE ENGINE</div>
        <div class="split">
          <div>
            <h2 class="h-section" id="dev-heading"><span id="dev-heading-text" class="char-reveal"></span></h2>
            <p class="lede" id="dev-lede1"><span id="dev-lede1-text" class="char-reveal"></span></p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="product-card reveal-item" data-step="2" onclick="openProductModal(this,'ARTIFIELD','Schedule · Cost · Supply — one decision engine','A single Google Sheets-backed control tower for construction — Consolidated Gantt, EVM cost tracking, and material shortage forecasting, all reading from the same imported data.',2,'ARTIFIELD')">
              <div class="icon-tile"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="4" y1="6" x2="14" y2="6"/><line x1="4" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><line x1="4" y1="18" x2="10" y2="18"/></svg></div>
              <div style="flex:1;"><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:14.5px;">ARTIFIELD</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--t2);">Schedule · Cost · Supply</div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="product-card reveal-item" data-step="3" onclick="openProductModal(this,'Vex AI','Document standardization engine','Reads any construction document — schedule, cost sheet, NCR log, RFI — and outputs one strictly-formatted JSON schema ARTIFIELD can trust, with confidence flags on every record.',6,'Meet Vex AI')">
              <div class="icon-tile"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="3"/><path d="M9 9h.01M15 9h.01M9 15c1 1 5 1 6 0"/></svg></div>
              <div style="flex:1;"><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:14.5px;">Vex AI</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--t2);">Document standardization</div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal-item" data-step="4" style="margin-top:26px;display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:22px;">
          <div>
            <div style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px);color:var(--t1);line-height:1.2;"><span id="dev-notspread-text" class="char-reveal"></span></div>
            <div style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px);color:var(--t3);line-height:1.2;"><span id="dev-watchesyou-text" class="char-reveal"></span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 2 SCHEDULE -->
    <section class="slide" data-idx="2">
      <div class="slide-inner">
        <div class="slide-eyebrow"><span class="ln"></span>SCHEDULE INTELLIGENCE</div>
