              <div class="feat-item feat-item-modal" onclick="openProductModal(this,'SPI &amp; S-Curves','Planned vs actual, weight-based','Time-phased planned value against logged accomplishment, weighted by task WT%, drawn as a live S-Curve per building and per trade.',2,'ARTIFIELD')"><div class="icon-tile"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 17c3-1 4-6 7-8s5 6 8 4"/><path d="M3 21h18"/></svg></div><div class="f-lbl">SPI &amp; S-Curves</div></div>
              <div class="feat-item feat-item-modal" onclick="openProductModal(this,'Clash &amp; Sequence Log','Cross-trade conflicts, caught automatically','Every building/floor is scanned for overlapping trades and predecessor/successor violations — flagged before the crews collide on site.',5,'Clash &amp; Sequence Log')"><div class="icon-tile"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3l9 16H3z"/><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13.5"/></svg></div><div class="f-lbl">Clash &amp; Sequence Log</div></div>
